            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Disposal of a ventilated ceiling system, commercial kitchen with 5'000-20'000 m3/h nominal air flow rate of the kitchen. Reference value of inventory is 1 m3/h air flow of the kitchen. Inventory is an average of 3 commercial kitchens with a total nominal air flow of  37670 m3/h, specific weight of the components: 0.2 kg/(m3/h). Exhaust and supply air ceiling system mainly made of stainless steel and aluminium. Stainless steel exhaust air hood for kitchen and/or dishwasher included. No ducts included.;
